-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("en",201,{
[6401]="7004E4EB\n1\tTalk to Tuhâl\tTuhâl seems to have something to say about the Jangovar's orders. You should talk to Tuhâl, who can be found in Utterby.\n2\tCollect animal meat (total: 15)\tAnimals can be found among the scrublands of the Ironfold. You should hunt animals for their meat.\n3\tBring the meat to Kúlkhur\tYou should bring the meat to Kúlkhur, who can be found inside Utterby.\n",
[6402]="7000EC04\n1\tDefeat Gauradan Ravagers (total: 6)\030Defeat Gauradan Stalkers (total: 6)\030Defeat Gauradan Seers (total: 6)\tThe Gauredain can be found on the great glacier across the Ice Bay to the west. Vämmä has asked you to hunt the Gauredain stalking the glaciers.\n2\tTalk to Vämmä\tVämmä is in Sûri-kylä, far to the east of the glacier, across the Ice Bay. With their numbers weakened, you should return to Vämmä and see what else might be done to end the Gauradan threat.\n",
[6403]="70026F06\n1\tDefeat Bloodmaw, the avanc matriarch\tBloodmaw may be found at the centre of the Withered Stones in the southern Dunbog. Harri has asked you to kill Bloodmaw, the Avanc matriarch.\n2\tTalk to Harri at the hunters' camp\tHarri is at the hunters' camp, near the western edge of the southern Dunbog. You should return to Harri and tell him that you have accomplished all that he has asked.\n",
[6404]="70058411\n1\tCollect strange crystal\tZarkul-sulûn can be found in southern Elderslade. You should look for strange crystals for Mother Amma.\n2\tBring the crystal to Mother Amma\tMother Amma is in the forge at Annâk-khurfu. You should bring the crystal to Mother Amma.\n",
[6405]="70007F47\n1\tBring the fetish to Grímkell\030Collect Goblin-fetish\tVífill said there were goblins south of his camp. Grímkell told you he would only be convinced of Vífill's tale if you could bring him an authentic goblin fetish.\n",
[6406]="7005AB11\n1\tDefeat hobgoblin hunters (total: 7)\tHobgoblin hunters can be found near Ibdêkh-buzru, the Thing-fold. You should defeat hobgoblin hunters.\n2\tTalk to Kyrstig\tKyrstig can be found near Ibdêkh-buzru, the Thing-fold. You should talk to Kyrstig.\n",
[6407]="700597FB\n1\tDefeat Shadowbark Huorns (total: 6)\030Look for clues of the Huorn corruption\tShadowbark Huorns can be found in the southern Wildwood. Thornmane has asked you to defeat Shadowbark Huorns and look for clues.\n2\tTalk to Thornmane\tThornmane is located in the southern Wildwood. You should bring the rotted bark to Thornmane.\n",
[6408]="700577DB\n1\tDefeat Karghosh in the Floodfells\tOne of the warg packs that stalks the Floodfells is led by a large and frightening beast called Karghosh. If he is defeated, it is possible the rest of the pack will disband and flee the area.\n2\tDefeat Karghosh\tOne of the warg packs that stalks the Floodfells is led by a large and frightening beast called Karghosh. If he is defeated, it is possible the rest of the pack will disband and flee the area.\n3\tCompleted\tCompleted.\n",
[6409]="7003E2F3\n1\tAsk Colbert if he knows of any place where Olnathron might be hiding\tColbert the Mad is at Mincham's Camp in the southern Fields of Fornost, in the north-western North Downs.\n2\tFind and explore the strange piles of earth\030Search for the deathly lights\030Search for graves (total: 6)\tOlnathron could be hiding anywhere throughout the western Fields of Fornost. Mincham has asked you to investigate suspicious sites that might lead to Olnathron.\n3\tReturn to Mincham to tell of what you saw\tMincham is at his camp in the southern Fields of Fornost. You should speak with Mincham.\n",
[6410]="70053F1F\n1\tGather sûlok meat (total: 8)\tSûlokil can be found throughout Arandor. You should hunt sûlokil in order to gather meat for the soldiers of the Great Alliance.\n2\tBring the sûlok meat to Ohtar\tOhtar can be found at Díngarth. You should bring the sûlok meat to Ohtar.\n",
[6411]="700082AB\n1\tDefeat Wargs (total: 8)\tWarg packs prowl the hills of eastern Nan Amlug, befouling the land of the Rauta-lehmä. Elder Tahvo has asked you to prove your worth by slaying some Wargs.\n2\tReturn to Elder Tahvo\tElder Tahvo is at Rosfold, east across the mountain range from Esteldín. You should tell Elder Tahvo that you have fulfilled his requests, and many Wargs now lie slain by your hand.\n",
[6412]="7005B22A\n1\tRetrieve stolen supplies (total: 6)\tIn hopes of flushing out the thief, Múta has asked you to retrieve the remaining supplies at Durshulot. Durshulot sits on the middle tier, east of Gabil-memâg.\n2\tReturn to Múta at Gabil-memâg\tYou have retrieved the stolen supplies. You should return to Múta at Gabil-memâg, west of Durshulot.\n3\tTalk to Shúkurz\tMúta has captured the Orc thief. You should talk to him.\n4\tTalk to Múta\tThe Orc seems to be done rambling. You should talk to Múta and figure out what to do with him.\n5\tTalk to Náin in Aslíf\tMúta will return to Aslíf on the upper tier with the Orc as a prisoner. Náin will be interested to hear what you have to say about what happened.\n",
[6413]="70062142\n1\tCollect deer meat (total: 8)\tHal Wolfscomb has asked you to hunt Ruddymore does and bucks and to bring back their meat to help feed his companions. Ruddymore does and bucks are roaming the fields north-west of Tharbad, in Cardolan.\n2\tReturn to Hal Wolfscomb\tYou should bring the deer meat to Hal Wolfscomb. Hal is in a small encampment in northern Tharbad.\n",
[6414]="70043E02\n1\tKill Gondorian Captains (total: 5)\tGondorian Captains can be found in enemy strongholds in Osgiliath. You should kill Gondorian Captains.\n2\tListen to Grazadhal yell at you\tGrazadhal is at Dâr Dugoth. You should listen to Grazadhal yell at you.\n",
[6415]="70059350\n1\tTalk to Nye Crowfoot\tNye Crowfoot can be found at Trader's Wharf. You should talk to Nye Crowfoot.\n2\tCheck traps for meat in the Wildwood (total: 6)\030Check traps for live catches the Wildwood (total: 6)\tTraps can be found in the Wildwood. You should check traps in the Wildwood.\n3\tTalk to Nye Crowfoot in the wilds of the Wildwood\tNye Crowfoot can be found in the wilds of the Wildwood. You should talk to Nye Crowfoot in the Wildwood.\n4\tBait the large game traps (quantity: see journal)\030Let live critters back into the wilds (quantity: see journal)\tLarge game traps can be found in the Wildwood. You should bait the large game traps and let the live critters go back into the wilds.\n5\tTalk to Enid Nettlesting\tEnid Nettlesting can be found at Trader's Wharf. You should talk to Enid Nettlesting.\n",
[6416]="7005A2EB\n1\tCollect moose meat (total: 3)\030Collect boar meat (total: 8)\030Collect deer meat (total: 8)\tMoose, deer, and wild boar can be found throughout the woods of Azanulbizar. Dráttur has tasked you with hunting the woods for meat to feed the army.\n2\tTalk to Dráttur\tDráttur is in Amdân. You should bring the meat to Dráttur.\n",
[6417]="700529EA\n1\tCollect venison (total: 10)\tTo gain the favour of the villagers of Arhaim, you have been asked to hunt deer in Duskenvale. You should collect venison from the deer in Duskenvale.\n2\tTalk to Goslim\tGoslim can be found in the village of Arhaim in Duskenvale. You should bring the collected venison to Goslim.\n",
[6418]="7005B500\n1\tDefeat Mádath\030Defeat worms in Clovengap (total: 12)\030Investigate Mádath's experiments\tThe Angmarim priest can be found in north-eastern Clovengap. You should find and defeat the priest who is working to corrupt the worms.\n2\tReturn to Mother Amma\tMother Amma is at Bazanmanar, in north-east Clovengap. You should bring the new fragment to Mother Amma.\n",
[6419]="70009985\n1\tDefeat Gauredain tribesmen (total: 5)\030Defeat Gauredain gorge-stalkers (total: 8)\030Defeat a Gauradan soothsayer\tErchiel has asked you to defeat a number of Gauredain in order to instill in them a healthy fear of the forests. The Gauredain she speaks of can be found in the forests north of the river that passes by the Eavespires.\n2\tTalk to Erchiel\tErchiel is at the Eavespires on the north-west shore of Lake Evendim. You should return and tell Erchiel of your forays against the Gauredain.\n",
[6420]="7004DA65\n1\tCollect slabs of boar meat (total: 14)\030Collect cuts of venison (total: 14)\tSlabs of boar meat can be obtained from boars of the north. Cuts of venison can be obtained from deer of the north. Dréri has asked you to aid the Stout-axes in hunting the beasts of the north in an effort to replenish their food-stores.\n2\tDeliver the meat to Dréri in Erebor\tDréri can be found in the Hall Under the Mountain. You have gathered a great deal of meat from the beasts of the north and should now return to Dréri.\n",
[6421]="7002724E\n1\tDefeat dusk-hounds in the South Gravenwood (total: 10)\tAndreg has asked you to help him slay a few dusk-hounds in the South Gravenwood.\n2\tTalk to Andreg\tYou should speak with Andreg about your successes against the dusk-hounds of the South Gravenwood.\n",
[6422]="70030A72\n1\tWarbands of enemies can be found roaming across the plains of the Norcrofts. The trader's outpost offered a reward for any adventurers capable of defeating a warband of enemies in the Norcrofts.\t\n2\tSpeak to the merchant guard captain at the trader's outpost\tThe guard captain of the merchants can be found at the trader's outpost, west of Elthengels. The guard captain has promised a reward for any capable of defeating a warband of the Norcrofts.\n",
[6423]="7002C5D3\n1\tCollect Huorn-seeds (total: 4)\tThickbark has asked you to gather seeds from the hostile Huorns growing on the Gorge side of the Limlight River and to drive the dangerous creatures back into slumber if you can.\n2\tBring the Huorn-seeds to Thickbark\tYou should bring the Huorn-seeds you have collected to Thickbark at the Limlight Glade in the Limlight Gorge.\n",
[6424]="70037211\n1\tDeal with the Black Huorns before they become uncontrollable\tYou have seen Black Huorns gathering in the shadows of the trees in Fangorn. You should deal with them before they become uncontrollable.\n2\tDefeat Black Huorns in Fangorn (total: 6)\tYou have seen Black Huorns gathering in the shadows of the trees in Fangorn. You should deal with them before they become uncontrollable.\n3\tBring the black heartwood you found to the Ent who herds this part of Fangorn\tWith Huorns in the area, there may be an Ent nearby. You should find the Ent who herds this part of Fangorn.\n",
[6425]="7000B3DD\n1\tPlace the heartwood on the stump\030Obtain a Leafcull heart\tSeek a Leafcull Huorn within the southern stretches of the Grimwood. Cut out its heart and place it on the stump near the Grimwood Lumber Camp. Taskmaster Gazgortag believes that you can draw the Huorns into conflict with the Free People currently occupying the Grimwood Lumber Camp. He directed you to cut out the heart of the leafcull Huorn in attempt to draw out the enemy.\n",
[6426]="7002BFA6\n1\tFind the Dunlending representative\tThe Dunlending Bagmund spoke of can be found at the Easterling camp, south of the Woodmen's camp in the Rushgore. Bagmund asked you to take the Dunlending relics you found to a Dunlending his party has seen in the Rushgore.\n2\tFind the Dunlending representative\tThe Dunlending Bagmund spoke of can be found at the Easterling camp, east of Aculf's camp in the Rushgore. Bagmund asked you to take the Dunlending relics you found to a Dunlending his party has seen in the Rushgore.\n3\tTalk to Bagmund at Aculf's camp in the Rushgore\tBagmund is at Aculf's camp in the Rushgore, west of the Easterling camp. You should return to Bagmund and revile him for sending you on such a dishonourable errand.\n",
[6427]="70050A0A\n1\tDefeat Héolka, Scourge of the Withered Heath\tHéolka poses a great threat to all that enter the Withered Heath.\n2\tDefeat Héolka, Scourge of the Withered Heath\tHéolka poses a great threat to all that enter the Withered Heath.\n3\tCompleted\tHéolka poses a great threat to all that enter the Withered Heath.\n",
[6428]="700088B9\n1\tReturn to Soldier Fandmau at Tírith Rhaw\030Collect sacks of food (total: 5)\030Collect fragments of troll-stone (total: 5)\tTroll-stone shards will likely be found from smaller or larger pieces of the trolls caught in the sunlight. Food can be found on the enemy or the rat-folk in Hoarhallow. Soldier Fandmau needs some help proving out a theory he has.\n",
[6429]="7004C382\n1\tTalk to Donnamira Took in the library of Great Smials\tDonnamira Took is in the library of Great Smials, in Tuckborough.\n2\tOne of the book-shelves in the library of Great Smials may have a suitably scary book to serve Bingo's needs.\t\n3\tTalk to Donnamira Took in the library of Great Smials\tDonnamira Took is in the library of Great Smials, in Tuckborough.\n4\tBring the scary book to Bingo Boffin near the Party Tree\tBingo Boffin is near the Party Tree, in Hobbiton.\n",
[6430]="7004C385\n1\tTalk to Bingo and help him scare his many cousins with tales of terror\tBingo is near the Party Tree, in Hobbiton.\n2\tTalk to Bingo Boffin on the Greenfields\tBingo is on the Greenfields.\n3\tFind Dinodas Boffin in the Bindbole Wood\tDinodas Boffin ran off to the north-west of the Greenfields, and is now somewhere within the Bindbole Wood.\n4\tTalk to Dinodas Boffin in the Bindbole Wood\tDinodas Boffin is in the Bindbole Wood.\n",
[6431]="7004C38B\n1\tReturn to the location of the spectral vision in the Bindbole Wood\tBingo wants to see the spectral vision for himself, and asked you to lead him to it.\n2\tTalk to Bingo in the Bindbole Wood\030Talk to Dinodas in the Bindbole Wood\tBingo and Dinodas have come to the location where you saw the spectral apparition, but now there is no sign of it.\n3\tBingo thinks you might find some sign of the apparition if you climb on top of the old building on the hill where it appeared.\t\n4\tTalk to Bingo in the Bindbole Wood\tBingo is in the Bindbole Wood, where the spectral apparition appeared.\n",
[6432]="7004C412\n1\tPick up the spare apple-bobbing tub at the base of the Hill\tA spare apple-bobbing tub can be found near the base of the Hill, but be sure to avoid Bobbers-to-Be while you carry it back to Camellia Boffin. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n2\tTalk to Camellia Boffin near the Party Tree\tCamellia Boffin is by the apple-bobbing game near the Party Tree.\n3\tPick up the spare apple-bobbing tub in Appledores\tA spare apple-bobbing tub can be found within Appledores, the orchard on the Hill, but be sure to avoid Bobbers-to-Be while you carry it back to Camellia Boffin. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n4\tTalk to Camellia Boffin near the Party Tree\tCamellia Boffin is by the apple-bobbing game near the Party Tree.\n",
})
